            fb_r1_lowball: `Quoting low and charging extras at delivery lifts the month's profit and turns every delivery into an argument: the customer pays for what he never authorised and does not come back.`,
            fb_r1_street: `At 380 pesos an hour the shop loses on every hour it sells: each hour sold costs about 397 pesos before any margin. And with the shop full, the low price only lengthens the queue.`,
