            fb_r3_promo: `The promotion pack is cheap per part and expensive for the cash: 320,000 pesos on the shelf that rotate slowly.`,
            fb_r3_accept: `With 60 days of credit and 10% off, the shop finances the fleet's operation: two months of work stays in the customer's hands.`,
            fb_r3_cheap: `The cheapest part saves today and brings the car back tomorrow: more comebacks and a customer who no longer trusts you.`,
